## How to read red vs green

Designed red: matching tool on its specimen → NOT_MET.
Assert-fails scripts → exit 0 ASSERT:PASS.
Designed pass: invoice-correct MET; assert-impact-graph-generated.py ASSERT:PASS.
True miss: invoice-correct red, assert-fails exit 1, or a specimen green on its own tool.

